  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F.",
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine cassava flour, coconut oil, jerk seasoning, scotch bonnet peppers, allspice, ginger, and brown sugar. ",
    "Mix well until a dough forms.",
    "Press the dough into a greased baking dish.",
    "Bake for 30 minutes. ",
    "Remove from oven and stir in coconut milk. ",
    "Return to oven and bake for an additional 20 minutes. ",
    "Remove from oven and sprinkle with cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Serve warm."
